# ==========================================
# Ignition 8.3 - Full Gateway Data Gitignore
# ==========================================



# 1. Database & Cache Files
**/db/
**/metricsdb/
**/autobackup/
**/db_backup_sqlite.idb
**/valueStore.idb
**/jar-cache/

# 2. Network Requests / Temp Files
**/request
**/response
*.tmp
*.bak
**/var

# 3. Log Files
*.log
**/logs

# 4. Certificates and Local Security (Keep out of source control!)
**/certificates/
**/keystore/

# 5. Environment / Runtime Configurations
**/config/local
**/config/resources/local
**/.container-init.conf

# 6. Backup, Upgrade, and Migration Reports
**/conversion-report.txt
**.digest.json
**/projects/conversion-report.txt
**/migration-log-*.md

# 7. Internal System Bookkeeping
**/.resources/
**/.alarms_*
.DS_Store
thumbnail.png

